    "name": "Effective date, parties, and purpose",
    "text": "This Agreement, effective upon signing, governs an arrangement whereby Dr, Dario Campana of St. Jude Children's Research Hospital, inc e (\"St. Jude\") agrees to provide biological material that is proprietary to St. Jude, for use In a collaborative research study with Dr. Carl June (\"Recipient Scientist') of th University of Pennsylvania (\"Recipient\"), subject to the terms and conditions set forth below."
